--
N5008 [temp.variadic]/5: a base-specifier impl<F, A...> of a partial
specialization RO<F(A...)> must expand A... to every element deduced from
the function-type pattern; substituting the base template-id per argument
collapsed the pack to its first element (impl<F, A0>, so libstdc++'s
result_of<F(A...)> : __invoke_result<F, A...> had no ::type).
